<title>USA: St Louis feeder cattle prices mixed - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Louis feeder cattle prices mixed - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>EAST ST LOUIS, Ill. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>FEEDER CATTLE AUCTION:  300 head. Compared with last week, feeder steers unevenly $1.00-$3.00 per cwt higher. Feeder heifers unevenly $1.00 to $3.00 lower. Overall quality comparable to last weeks level. Moderate buyer attendance.</p>
<p>FEEDER STEERS: Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>500-600 lbs. 79.00-85.00,</p>
<p>600-700 lbs. 74.00-81.00,</p>
<p>Moderately Fleshy:</p>
<p>400-600 lbs. 70.00-78.00</p>
<p>600-800 lbs. 65.00-74.00</p>
<p>LARGE FRAME 2 HOLSTEINS: Package 985 lbs. at 50.50.</p>
<p>FEEDER HEIFERS:  Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>500-600 lbs. 69.00-75.00.  Moderately Fleshy:</p>
<p>400-600 lbs. 67.00-73.00</p>
<p>600-700 lbs. 60.00-67.00</p>
<p>Receipts 300   Last week  275   Last Year 300</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
